<style>
/* Monroe contact page - Shopify scoped styling */
.ms-contact{
  max-width: 1600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px 40px;
  font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #000000;
}
.ms-contact,
.ms-contact *{
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif !important;
}
.ms-contact p,
.ms-contact li,
.ms-contact a,
.ms-contact span,
.ms-contact strong,
.ms-contact em,
.ms-contact address{
  font-size: 18px !important;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: #000000;
}
.ms-contact h2,
.ms-contact h2 *{
  font-size: 40px !important;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-contact h3,
.ms-contact h3 *{
  font-size: 25px !important;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-contact h4,
.ms-contact h4 *{
  font-size: 20px !important;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: #000000 !important;
}
.ms-contact a{
  color: #007681 !important;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}
.ms-contact address{
  font-style: normal;
  margin: 0;
}
.ms-contact iframe{
  display: block;
  width: 100% !important;
  max-width: 800px;
  height: 360px;
  margin: 18px auto;
  border: 0;
}
@media (max-width: 749px){
  .ms-contact{
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 12px;
  }
  .ms-contact h2,
  .ms-contact h2 *{
    font-size: 32px !important;
  }
  .ms-contact iframe{
    height: 300px;
  }
}
</style>

<section class="ms-contact" aria-label="Monroe Systems for Business Contact Information">
<div style="font-size: 18px; color: #000000; font-family: Roboto;">
<p style="background-color: #007681; height: 35px;">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style="text-align: center; text-decoration: none; font-size: 40px; color: #000000;">Monroe Systems for Business Contact Information</h2>
<p>Are you looking to contact Monroe Systems for Business or need to submit a purchase order? You've come to the right place. Our team is available to support you and ensure all your queries and requirements are addressed swiftly and effectively.</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 25px; color: #000000;">Phone Support</h3>
<p>Monroe Systems for Business has been the industry leader in printing calculators and office supplies for over 110 years. You can contact one of our calculator customer service representatives directly by phone at <a style="color: #007681;" title="Monroe Systems for Business Customer Service Phone Number" href="tel:2675802600">(267) 580-2600</a>, or toll-free at <a style="color: #007681;" title="Monroe Systems for Business Toll Free Customer Service Phone Number" href="tel:8886667631">(888) 666-7631</a>. Our dedicated customer service team is available Monday through Friday from 8 am to 5 pm ET to assist you with any questions or to help you with your purchase orders.</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 25px; color: #000000;">Email Communication</h3>
<p>For general inquiries or customer support, please email us at <a style="color: #007681;" title="Monroe Systems for Business Customer Service Email Address" href="mailto:csr@monroe-systems.com">csr@monroe-systems.com</a>.</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 25px; color: #000000;">Submit A Purchase Order</h3>
<p>If you need to submit a purchase order, you can send it directly to <a style="color: #007681;" title="Monroe Systems for Business Purchase Order Email Address" href="mailto:orders@monroe-systems.com">orders@monroe-systems.com</a>. Our team ensures that all emails are responded to promptly.</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 25px; color: #000000;">Our Office Address</h3>
<p>Should you prefer to contact us by mail or wish to visit us, our office is located at:</p>
<address><strong><em>Monroe Systems for Business</em></strong></address><address><strong><em>511 William Leigh Drive</em></strong></address><address><strong><em>Suite 15</em></strong></address><address><strong><em>Tullytown, PA 19007</em></strong></address>
<p><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3050.0684722274013!2d-74.81205038435715!3d40.14075848030062!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x89c15044800eb2e5%3A0x8f181a61d6ea71cd!2s511%20William%20Leigh%20Dr%2C%20Tullytown%2C%20PA%2019007!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1620934475047!5m2!1sen!2sus" width="400" height="300" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></p>
<h3 style="font-size: 25px; color: #000000;">Tax-Exempt Customers</h3>
<p>If you are a tax-exempt customer, please contact our office directly. Our systems default accounts to retail settings, and a call is required to ensure your account is set up correctly.</p>
<p style="background-color: #007681; height: 35px;">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</section>

